===Noun===
{{en-noun|es|pl2=weirdos}}

#{{slang}} a strange, odd, eccentric person.
#{{slang}} an insane, possibly dangerous person.
#{{slang}} any person who is behaving in a [[socially]] [[unacceptable]] [[fashion]] or [[manner]], at least as judged by a [[socially]] [[acceptable]] person.
#{{slang}} [[oddly]] [[enough]](!), when [[uttered]] in [[reference]] to [[himself]] or to [[herself]] by a person who considers the designation to be a badge of honor, as someone who is actually proud to be called such a thing.  Example:  "Yeah, I'm a real weirdo".
#{{slang}} [[most]] [[strangely(!)]], when [[uttered]] as a [[self]]-[[reference]] as only one word in a long chain of words, is usually quite proud to be called such a thing.  Example:  "

